### 회원가입 (IntelliJ에서 왼쪽 ▶ 버튼으로 실행)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jeongwoo@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickname": "정우",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "grade": "C"
}

### 같은 이메일로 한 번 더 → 409 DUPLICATE_EMAIL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jeongwoo@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickname": "다른닉네임",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "grade": "C"
}

### 이메일 형식 오류 → 400 INVALID_REQUEST
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickname": "테스트",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "grade": "C"
}
